        {
          "text": "By signing below, I hereby agree to be held personally liable for all costs and charges relating to the above referenced reservation including,",
          "x": 44.1,
          "y": 373.46500000000003,
          "width": 494.6319999999996,
          "height": 8.0,
          "fontSize": 8.0,
          "fontFamily": "Arial",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "text": "without limitation, the total room rate and any incidental charges (collectively, \"Charges\"). I further agree to be held personally liable for any and all",
          "x": 44.1,
          "y": 384.18300000000005,
          "width": 518.4399999999996,
          "height": 8.0,
          "fontSize": 8.0,
          "fontFamily": "Arial",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "text": "claims, demands, damages, liabilities, expenses, losses of every nature and kind (collectively), \"Claims\") arising out of the intentional or negligent",
          "x": 44.1,
          "y": 394.901,
          "width": 513.1359999999997,
          "height": 8.0,
          "fontSize": 8.0,
          "fontFamily": "Arial",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "text": "acts or omissions of any guest staying at or visiting the Hotel in connection with the above-referenced reservation. I hereby authorize the Hotel to",
          "x": 44.1,
          "y": 405.619,
          "width": 511.4559999999997,
          "height": 8.0,
          "fontSize": 8.0,
          "fontFamily": "Arial",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "text": "charge the credit or debit card on file with the Hotel for any and all Charges and/or Claims, and I certify that I am an authorized user of such credit",
          "x": 44.1,
          "y": 416.33700000000005,
          "width": 514.0719999999998,
          "height": 8.0,
          "fontSize": 8.0,
          "fontFamily": "Arial",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "text": "or debit card and will not dispute any Charges or Claims with my bank or credit card company. Money, jewelry, precious stones and other",
          "x": 44.1,
          "y": 427.055,
          "width": 487.02399999999966,
          "height": 8.0,
          "fontSize": 8.0,
          "fontFamily": "Arial",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "text": "valuables brought to the Hotel are at my sole risk and the Hotel does not accept these items for safekeeping. Pursuant to \u00a7509.111, Florida",
          "x": 44.1,
          "y": 437.773,
          "width": 491.4639999999996,
          "height": 8.0,
          "fontSize": 8.0,
          "fontFamily": "Arial",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "text": "Statues, the Hotel is not liable for any loss and damage thereto. Such items should not be left unattended anywhere on Hotel property, including in",
          "x": 44.1,
          "y": 448.49100000000004,
          "width": 516.7999999999996,
          "height": 8.0,
          "fontSize": 8.0,
          "fontFamily": "Arial",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "text": "the Hotel room and/or any in-room safe, under any circumstances. In the event I wish for the Hotel to store any of my personal belongings in the",
          "x": 44.1,
          "y": 459.209,
          "width": 508.32799999999975,
          "height": 8.0,
          "fontSize": 8.0,
          "fontFamily": "Arial",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "text": "Hotel's safety box, I hereby agree to make such request to the front desk in writing (which request may be declined in Hotel's sole discretion) and",
          "x": 44.1,
          "y": 469.927,
          "width": 511.83199999999977,
          "height": 8.0,
          "fontSize": 8.0,
          "fontFamily": "Arial",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "text": "provide Hotel with an inventory of such items and the value thereof. The Setai is a non-smoking hotel. Smoking is only permitted in designated",
          "x": 44.1,
          "y": 480.64500000000004,
          "width": 505.05899999999997,
          "height": 8.0,
          "fontSize": 8.0,
          "fontFamily": "Arial",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "text": "open areas. In case of smoking indoors, I understand and agree that the Hotel may charge my debit or credit card a minimum fee of $500 daily for",
          "x": 44.1,
          "y": 491.363,
          "width": 515.8199999999999,
          "height": 8.0,
          "fontSize": 8.0,
          "fontFamily": "Arial",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "text": "deep cleaning. I have read and understand all terms and conditions described above and agree to comply with foregoing terms and conditions",
          "x": 44.1,
          "y": 502.081,
          "width": 503.99999999999966,
          "height": 8.0,
          "fontSize": 8.0,
          "fontFamily": "Arial",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "text": "and all other rules and regulations applicable to guests at the Hotel.",
          "x": 44.1,
          "y": 512.8,
          "width": 238.6400000000003,
          "height": 8.0,
          "fontSize": 8.0,
          "fontFamily": "Arial",
          "bold": false
